DiscoRL in C++

This project is a C++ reimplementation of DiscoRL,
https://github.com/google-deepmind/disco_rl
Copyright 2025 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The update rules, networks, value estimation and meta-training follow the
Python/JAX sources of disco_rl, ported to C++ and LibTorch. No weights from
disco_rl are included.
